    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Strength Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=bOzXWOZF95NqFnXk]], one Large or smaller creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} can see within 15 feet. <em>Failure:</em> The target is pulled up to 10 feet straight toward the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} and has the &amp;Reference[Grappled apply=false] condition (escape DC 16) from one of six roots. Until the grapple ends, the target takes [[/damage 2d6 + 6 average type=bludgeoning]] damage at the start of each of its turns.</p>",
